{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你们要称你们的弟兄为阿米",{"noteId":3},"，称你们的姊妹为路哈玛",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不贞的歌篾—不忠的以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你们要与你们的母亲大大争辩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她不是我的妻子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不是她的丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫她除掉脸上的淫像","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和胸间的淫态，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得我剥她的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她赤体，与才生的时候一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她如旷野，如干旱之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因渴而死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不怜悯她的儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们是从淫乱而生的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的母亲行了淫乱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怀他们的母做了可羞耻的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她说：我要随从所爱的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的饼、水、羊毛、麻、油、酒","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是他们给的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我必用荆棘堵塞她的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"筑墙挡住她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她找不着路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必追随所爱的，却追不上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必寻找他们，却寻不见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便说：我要归回前夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我那时的光景比如今还好。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不知道是我给她五谷、新酒，和油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又加增她的金银；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她却以此供奉","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"巴力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此到了收割的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出酒的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必将我的五谷、新酒收回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必将她应当遮体的羊毛和麻夺回来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我必在她所爱的眼前显露她的丑态；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必无人能救她脱离我的手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必使她的宴乐、节期、月朔、安息日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并她的一切大会都止息了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必毁坏她的葡萄树和无花果树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是她说「这是我所爱的给我为赏赐」的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使这些树变为荒林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为田野的走兽所吃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必追讨她素日给诸巴力烧香的罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时她佩带耳环和别样妆饰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"随从她所爱的，却忘记我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["神对他子民的爱"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"后来我必劝导她，领她到旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对她说安慰的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她从那里出来，我必赐她葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又赐她亚割谷作为指望的门。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必在那里应声","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与幼年的日子一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与从埃及地上来的时候相同。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和华说：「那日你必称呼我伊施",{"noteId":7},"，不再称呼我巴力",{"noteId":8},"；"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["因为我必从我民的口中除掉诸巴力的名号，这名号不再提起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["当那日，我必为我的民，与田野的走兽和空中的飞鸟，并地上的昆虫立约；又必在国中折断弓刀，止息争战，使他们安然躺卧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我必聘你永远归我为妻，以仁义、公平、慈爱、怜悯聘你归我；"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["也以诚实聘你归我，你就必认识我—耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：那日我必应允，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必应允天，天必应允地；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必应允五谷、新酒，和油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些必应允耶斯列民","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必将她种在这地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"素不蒙怜悯的，我必怜悯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"本非我民的，我必对他说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必说：你是我的 神。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"就是我民的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"就是蒙怜悯的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"或译：制造","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或译：歌唱","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":15}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"就是我夫的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"就是我主的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"-","text":"耶斯列就是 神栽种的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":22}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}